 602               /ROUTINE TO CALCULATE THE SHIP OUTLINE FROM CENTRAL
 603               /COORDINATES AND OUTLINE.  REQIRES THE FOLLOWING PAGE 0'S
 604               /BE PREVIOUSLY SET UP:
 605               /       QXPOS   X-CORD CENTER OF SHIP
 606               /       QYPOS   Y-CORD CENTER OF SHIP
 607               /       QSINPH  SINE OF SHIP ANGLE FROM X AXIS
 608               /       QCOSPH  COS  OF SHIP ANGLE FROM X AXIS
 609               /       QSHIP   POINTS TO START OF SHIP OUTLINE TABLE
 610               /       QSHIPN  NUMBER OF POINTS IN SHIP OUTLINE
 611               /       QTIME   OUTLINE SCALE FACTOR
 612               
 613               /IF SHIP IS NOT ALIVE OR IN HYPERSPACE THEN FAST EXIT.
 614               /COSINES AND SIGNS MUST ALLREADY BE AVAILABLE.
 615               /ALGORITHM:
 616               /       X=QXPOS + XS*COS(PH) - YS*SIN(PH)
 617               /       Y=QYPOS + XS*SIN(PH) + YS*COS(PH)
 618               /WHERE XS AND YS ARE POINTS ON SHIP OUTLINE FROM QSHIP TABLE.
 619               /THIS ROUTINE MAKES USE OF SYMMETRY
 620               
