 920               /THIS ROUTINE IS TO CALCULATE THE NEW POSITIONS
 921               /AND VELOCITIES OF A POINT ON SCREEN UNDER THE
 922               /INFLUENCE OF A THRUST AND GRAVITY.
 923               /THE ALGORITHM IS WIERD, MAINLY BECAUSE I PROBABLY
 924               /HAVE NOT FIGURED OUT THE GOOD WAY TO DO IT BUT, HERE
 925               /IS HOW THE CALCULATION PROCEEDS:
 926               /  1.   ACCELLERATION DUE TO GRAVITY IS CALCULATED VIA
 927               /       THE ROUTINE GGRAV.  THIS ROUTINE SETS UP
 928               /       QSINTH_SIN(TH)/R
 929               /       QCOSTH_COS(TH)/R
 930               /       AC_-QGRAV/R FROM LOOKUP TABLE
 931               /       WHERE TH=ANGLE WITH SUN AND R=SQROOT(X^2+Y^2)
 932               /  2.   NEW VALUES FOR THE COMPONENTS OF VELOCITY IS COMPUTED
 933               /       FROM QVX_QVX+QTHR*COS(PH)-GRAV*SIN(TH)
 934               /            QVY_QVY+QTHR*SIN(PH)-GRAV*COS(TH)
 935               /  3.   NEW VALUES OF X,Y ARE COMPUTED
 936               /       QXPOS_QXPOS+QVX*(SCALE FACTOR)
 937               /       QYPOS_QYPOS+QVY*(SCALE FACTOR)
 938               /ALSO DOES WRAP-AROUND CHECKS AND BOUNCE IF ON.
